{"municipality_code":"12342","pref":"千葉県","city":"神崎町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"神崎町には、並木村、小松村、松崎新田など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「神崎神社」、「西の城貝塚」、「北の内古墳」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では並木村、小松村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 田・新田・用水にちなむ地名が多い場所では、土地改良碑や用水記念碑も注目したい探索対象です。 ゆかりの人物では磯辺サタや永長佐京に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「神崎神社」や「神崎の大クス」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":9,"rank":1372,"percentile":26.6,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":34,"rank":745,"percentile":59.7,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":5,"rank":1362,"percentile":21.0,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":3,"rank":1069,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":15,"rank":946,"percentile":48.0,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["磯辺サタ"